      },
      "message": "fix(mcp): refuse null ids, survive oversize and non-UTF-8 lines, name nested patch typos\n\nThe stdio MCP server now refuses a request whose id is null as an\ninvalid request; reads each wire line as bytes capped at 16 MiB, so an\noversize line is a parse error skipped without being held in memory and\na non-UTF-8 line is a parse error the session reads past; refuses a\nmisspelled field at any depth of a params patch by its dotted path\n(e.g. clearance_z.ofset), not only at the top level; and post reports\nthe path v_post actually wrote.\n\nFixes #443\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
